  "caption": "10: one menu on every piece: its words, its fixes, Only when needed, Hide this, Settings for this.",
  "html": "<div class=\"kanso-story\"><div class=\"kanso-story__frame kanso-story--wide\"><div class=\"kanso-story--board\">\n    <div class=\"kanso-story__scroll\">\n      <div class=\"kanso-story__layout-row kanso-story__theme\">\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"kanso-story__caption\">A header segment</p>\n          <div class=\"kanso-story__stage\" style=\"width:620px;height:300px;box-sizing:border-box\">\n            <div class=\"kanso-window--preview\" style=\"width:584px\"><div class=\"kanso-header\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon--program\"><use href=\"#p-codex\"/></svg><span class=\"kanso-header__name\">docs</span><span class=\"kanso-header__branch\">~/acme-shop-docs</span><span class=\"kanso-header__branch\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon kanso-icon--inline\"><use href=\"#lu-git-branch\"/></svg>limits-docs</span><span class=\"kanso-header__digest\"><span class=\"kanso-header__segment\">2 files <span class=\"kanso-header__process\">+18 −2</span></span><span class=\"kanso-header__segment kanso-control--hover\"><i class=\"kanso-dot kanso-dot--done\"></i>#166 <span class=\"kanso-text--done\">· ready</span></span></span><span class=\"kanso-layout__grow\"></span><svg class=\"kanso-mark kanso-mark--done\"><use href=\"#e-done\"/></svg><svg class=\"kanso-icon kanso-icon--row kanso-header__grip\"><use href=\"#lu-grip-vertical\"/></svg></div><div class=\"kanso-window__stub\" style=\"height:180px\"></div></div>\n            <svg class=\"kanso-story__pointer\" style=\"left:392px;top:42px\"><use href=\"#i-ptr\"/></svg>\n            <div class=\"kanso-menu\" style=\"position:absolute;left:398px;top:62px\">\n              <div class=\"kanso-menu__heading\">Pull request · #166</div>\n              <div class=\"kanso-menu-item\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon kanso-icon--row\"><use href=\"#lu-copy\"/></svg>Copy link</div>\n              <div class=\"kanso-menu-item\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon kanso-icon--row\"><use href=\"#lu-external-link\"/></svg>Open on GitHub</div>\n              <div class=\"kanso-menu__separator\"></div>\n              <div class=\"kanso-menu-item\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon kanso-icon--row\"><use href=\"#lu-check\"/></svg>Only when needed</div>\n              <div class=\"kanso-menu-item kanso-control--hover\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon kanso-icon--row\"><use href=\"#lu-eye-off\"/></svg>Hide this</div>\n              <div class=\"kanso-menu-item\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon kanso-icon--row\"><use href=\"#lu-sliders-vertical\"/></svg>Settings for this…</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"kanso-story__caption\">A panel button</p>\n          <div class=\"kanso-story__stage\" style=\"width:420px;height:300px;box-sizing:border-box\">\n            <div class=\"kanso-prototype__toolbar\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:var(--k-sp-1);height:48px;justify-content:flex-end\">\n              <span class=\"kanso-tab--panel\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon\"><use href=\"#lu-file\"/></svg></span><span class=\"kanso-tab--panel\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon\"><use href=\"#lu-chart-column\"/></svg></span><span class=\"kanso-tab--panel kanso-control--on\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon\"><use href=\"#lu-git-pull-request\"/></svg>PR</span><span class=\"kanso-tab--panel\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon\"><use href=\"#lu-trophy\"/></svg></span><span class=\"kanso-tab--panel\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon\"><use href=\"#lu-git-fork\"/></svg></span><span class=\"kanso-tab--panel\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon\"><use href=\"#lu-plug\"/></svg></span><span class=\"kanso-tab--panel\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon\"><use href=\"#lu-container\"/></svg></span>\n            </div>\n            <svg class=\"kanso-story__pointer\" style=\"left:224px;top:40px\"><use href=\"#i-ptr\"/></svg>\n            <div class=\"kanso-menu\" style=\"position:absolute;left:230px;top:60px\">\n              <div class=\"kanso-menu__heading\">PR panel</div>\n              <div class=\"kanso-menu-item kanso-control--hover\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon kanso-icon--row\"><use href=\"#lu-eye-off\"/></svg>Hide this</div>\n              <div class=\"kanso-menu-item\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon kanso-icon--row\"><use href=\"#lu-sliders-vertical\"/></svg>Settings for this…</div>\n              <div class=\"kanso-menu__separator\"></div>\n              <div class=\"kanso-menu-item\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon kanso-icon--row\"><use href=\"#lu-panels-top-left\"/></svg>Panels…</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"kanso-story__caption\">After Hide this</p>\n          <div class=\"kanso-story__stage\" style=\"width:340px;height:300px;box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:flex-end\">\n            <div style=\"width:300px;background:var(--popover);border-radius:8px;padding:12px 12px;box-shadow:var(--shadow),0 0 0 1px var(--border);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:var(--k-sp-2)\">\n              <svg class=\"kanso-icon kanso-icon--row kanso-text--muted\"><use href=\"#lu-eye-off\"/></svg><div style=\"flex:1\"><div style=\"font-size:12.5px\">Hidden: Pull request</div><div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:var(--dim);margin-top:var(--k-sp-1)\">gh stops for headers</div></div><span class=\"kanso-button--quiet kanso-text--foreground\" tabindex=\"0\">Undo</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    </div></div></div>"
